sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as Application
  participant SurfaceA as CanvasSurface A
  participant SurfaceB as CanvasSurface B
  participant SurfaceC as CanvasSurface C
  participant RuntimeA as CanvasRuntime A
  participant RuntimeB as CanvasRuntime B

  App->>SurfaceA: mount with CanvasRuntime A
  SurfaceA->>RuntimeA: attach surface token
  RuntimeA-->>SurfaceA: attach accepted

  App->>SurfaceB: mount with CanvasRuntime A
  SurfaceB->>RuntimeA: attach surface token
  RuntimeA--x SurfaceB: StateError("CanvasRuntime already has an active CanvasSurface.")
  Note over RuntimeA,SurfaceB: Rejection happens before pointer routing, paint, repaint-listener, or resourceResolver attachment side effects.
  Note over SurfaceA,RuntimeA: The existing active surface remains attached and owns the runtime surface boundary.

  App->>SurfaceB: mount with CanvasRuntime B
  SurfaceB->>RuntimeB: attach surface token
  RuntimeB-->>SurfaceB: attach accepted
  Note over RuntimeA,RuntimeB: Independent runtimes may have independent active surfaces at the same time.

  App->>SurfaceA: unmount
  SurfaceA->>RuntimeA: detach surface token
  RuntimeA-->>SurfaceA: detach accepted
  App->>SurfaceC: mount with CanvasRuntime A
  SurfaceC->>RuntimeA: attach surface token
  RuntimeA-->>SurfaceC: attach accepted
